  "slug": "steven-spielberg-movies",
  "name": "Steven Spielberg Movies",
  "tagline": "Sharks, dinosaurs and history, told by the master",
  "introHtml": "<p>Few directors have shaped the movies like Steven Spielberg. From the beach-clearing terror of Jaws to the wonder of Jurassic Park, his films turned the summer blockbuster into an event, and they still play just as well decades later.</p><p>He is just as at home with history. Schindler&#39;s List and Saving Private Ryan are two of the most powerful films ever made about the Second World War. Watch the trailers below, then find where to rent each one.</p>",
  "metaDescription": "Watch trailers for Steven Spielberg movies, from Jaws and Jurassic Park to Schindler's List and Saving Private Ryan, and find where to rent each one.",
